    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/ad920b94a760ec820ce7b4394f98ed61.poster.avif?t=1724777680\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/ad920b94a760ec820ce7b4394f98ed61.webm?t=1724777680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/ad920b94a760ec820ce7b4394f98ed61.mp4?t=1724777680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Egor\u2019s head! </h2><br>He had lost himself even before his thirties. <br>But that was not enough for the fate and Egor got fired. <br><br>Such events could be the last straw for anybody. Our hero\u2019s ego shuttered into pieces <br>and now each piece sounds in its own way. <br><br>Or maybe it\u2019s not just ego\u2019s shards but childhood and adolescence traumas <br>found a will and a voice.<br><br>Anyway, the end of this story depends on you. <br>Will our hero find a new job? Will he get rid of the voices in his head? <br><br>Now and further you and only you make all the decisions! <br>Egor\u2019s fate is in your hands. But maybe\u2026 they made you think like that\u2026<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/b637de6b2b127693214d7109f5e17adb.avif?t=1724777680\" /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/227812db0b40cb0f85a81f64f3ca4215.avif?t=1724777680\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/248895e39847b716d1bb262d30e0ab61.avif?t=1724777680\" /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/a74b0fb113d2b89d7893e0dbb6516899.avif?t=1724777680\" /></span><br><br><i>Whose voice is this exactly</i>?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> The battle in Voiceover is just a quarrel between two people, nothing more.  <br>Not enough arguments for the victory? New Egor\u2019s friends living in his head will help you with their own skills. <br>Push your enemies over the edge by maximizing their stress level! <br><br></li><li> Do your skills seem to be too weak? You can level them up and try again. <br>Would this worth it? Who knows...<br><br></li><li> Loneliness is not about our hero anymore. His new friends cannot but intervene <br>in the dialogues with the citizens and won\u2019t leave Egor alone. <br>Because each of them has their own view of life <br>and Egor\u2019s relations with the world.</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.poster.avif?t=1724777680\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.webm?t=1724777680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Meow! Please, don't forget about it ^^<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/4e004e678534be7a3c71792f0d38be18.avif?t=1724777680\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/ad920b94a760ec820ce7b4394f98ed61.poster.avif?t=1724777680\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/ad920b94a760ec820ce7b4394f98ed61.webm?t=1724777680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/ad920b94a760ec820ce7b4394f98ed61.mp4?t=1724777680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Egor\u2019s head! </h2><br>He had lost himself even before his thirties. <br>But that was not enough for the fate and Egor got fired. <br><br>Such events could be the last straw for anybody. Our hero\u2019s ego shuttered into pieces <br>and now each piece sounds in its own way. <br><br>Or maybe it\u2019s not just ego\u2019s shards but childhood and adolescence traumas <br>found a will and a voice.<br><br>Anyway, the end of this story depends on you. <br>Will our hero find a new job? Will he get rid of the voices in his head? <br><br>Now and further you and only you make all the decisions! <br>Egor\u2019s fate is in your hands. But maybe\u2026 they made you think like that\u2026<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/b637de6b2b127693214d7109f5e17adb.avif?t=1724777680\" /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/227812db0b40cb0f85a81f64f3ca4215.avif?t=1724777680\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555010/extras/248895e39847b716d1bb262d30e0ab61.avif?t=1724777680\" /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=